c7cpT6G","user":{"login":"DevMimas","id":44207756,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MjA3NzU2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44207756?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevMimas","html_url":"https://github.com/DevMimas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevMimas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevMimas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevMimas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevMimas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevMimas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevMimas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevMimas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevMimas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevMimas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-31T09:23:53Z","updated_at":"2025-12-31T09:23:53Z","body":"> Why would it align to an unrelated container? If you want to remove margins, set custom styleboxes in the theme override properties.\n\nWhy in an unrelated container? The check button is in a VBoxContainer. All other elements, such as labels and buttons, are flush with the edge, but the check button is not. There is a gap between the text and the edge of the container, which looks bad. I guess, that doesn't make sense in terms of design.\n\nI would have to check whether this can be corrected with the style boxes.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3701816966/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3776591929","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114440#issuecomment-3776591929","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114440","id":3776591929,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7hGjg5","user":{"login":"Arjun-singh-rawatt","id":225551708,"node_id":"U_kgDODXGlXA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/225551708?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt","html_url":"https://github.com/Arjun-singh-rawatt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-21T07:33:56Z","updated_at":"2026-01-21T07:33:56Z","body":"Thanks for the clear description.\nI can take this up and work on either clarifying this behavior in the documentation and/or exploring whether the default padding can be adjusted or better exposed for consistent alignment. Please let me know if that direction sounds good.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3776591929/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3779826675","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114440#issuecomment-3779826675","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114440","id":3779826675,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7hS5Pz","user":{"login":"Arjun-singh-rawatt","id":225551708,"node_id":"U_kgDODXGlXA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/225551708?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt","html_url":"https://github.com/Arjun-singh-rawatt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-21T17:16:10Z","updated_at":"2026-01-21T17:16:10Z","body":"The adjustments in the CheckButton’s stylebox (content margins and h_separation) do not bring any meaningful effect on the text’s left alignment.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3779826675/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3780722648","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114440#issuecomment-3780722648","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114440","id":3780722648,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7hWT_Y","user":{"login":"DevMimas","id":44207756,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MjA3NzU2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44207756?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevMimas","html_url":"https://github.com/DevMimas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevMimas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevMimas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevMimas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevMimas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevMimas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevMimas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevMimas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevMimas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevMimas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-21T19:17:12Z","updated_at":"2026-01-21T19:19:04Z","body":"> The adjustments in the CheckButton’s stylebox (content margins and h_separation) do not bring any meaningful effect on the text’s left alignment.\n\n@Arjun-explores-Arjun-learn Thank you for your interest in investigating this further! So that means there is currently no specific setting to influence the alignment behaviour of the text in a check box, specifically in this case.\n\n**Options:**\n1. Either describe the behaviour in the documentation (as you suggested)\n2. Implement a function in the inspector that allows alignment (the question remains whether this would be useful)\n3. Implement the behaviour permanently in the checkbox.\n\nTo me, this seems more like a design break. Why are all the other control nodes perfectly aligned to the left (in a VBoxContainer) and the checkbox or text is not? In my opinion, this contradicts the design.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3780722648/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3780992338","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114440#issuecomment-3780992338","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114440","id":3780992338,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7hXV1S","user":{"login":"Arjun-singh-rawatt","id":225551708,"node_id":"U_kgDODXGlXA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/225551708?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt","html_url":"https://github.com/Arjun-singh-rawatt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-21T20:22:35Z","updated_at":"2026-01-21T20:22:35Z","body":"Thank you for your direction. \n\nTo me (and my current skills), documenting the current behavior and holes in the design would be a good first step before considering design or API changes.\nI’ll proceed with documenting this. Please let me know if there are any specific points you’d like me to highlight or keep in mind.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"htt